{
  "answer": "To transfer messenger (iMessage/SMS) messages to a new iPhone, the most reliable method is to create a backup of your old iPhone and restore it to the new iPhone. You can use iCloud Backup: on your old iPhone, go to Settings > iCloud > Backup & Storage and tap Back Up Now. On your new iPhone, during setup select Restore from iCloud Backup. Alternatively, use iTunes: connect old iPhone to iTunes, click File > Devices > Back up, then connect new iPhone and choose Restore from this backup. Ensure both devices run the same iOS version for compatibility. If the messages are from Facebook Messenger, the retrieved context does not provide a method; for iMessage/SMS transfer, the methods above apply.",
  "citations": ["2", "3", "9", "10"],
  "insufficient_context": false
}

